1. If you experience lag while playing heavy games,
try lowering these values in system.prop:
ro.lmk.psi_complete_stall_ms=xxx
ro.lmk.psi_partial_stall_ms=xxx

*A lower value makes the system more aggressive about freeing RAM.

2. You can edit the ZRAM size using the action button or through the WebUI.

3. 
• Changes to boot-completed.sh are applied immediately.
• Changes to zram_size.conf require a reboot to take effect.
• Changes to system.prop require a reboot to take effect.
  